#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1231 expect=noViolation domain=LB
#note "Track B: adapted from FDA-SD1231-valid_nocondition-LB.cdt. Boundary: HGB matches no where-clause in the Define-XML value list, so no value-level length applies even though the value is long -> no violation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#define-xml PMDA-SD1231-define.xml
dataset LB
col USUBJID  type=Char
col LBTESTCD type=Char
col LBSPEC   type=Char
col LBSTRESC type=Char
---
001 | HGB  | BLOOD | 1234567890123
001 | GLUC | SERUM | 5.5
